OL,3,GNEWSASentencing after threat to bomb
OL,4,Acouncil leader
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman threatened to "burn and bomb" a
OL,7,Fcouncil leader's workplace, a court has
OL,8,Fheard.
OL,10,FKhadija Nadeem threatened to kill
OL,11,FShabina Qayyum, who is the leader of
OL,12,FPeterborough City Council, in a phone
OL,13,Fcall to the surgery where she works as
OL,14,Fa GP.
OL,16,FThe 40-year-old, of Reeves Way,
OL,17,FPeterborough, was sentenced to six
OL,18,Fmonths in prison, suspended for two
OL,19,Fyears, and she must complete 100 hours
OL,20,Fof unpaid work.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
