OL,3,GNEWSASentencing after threat to bomb
OL,4,Acouncil leader
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I want to feel safe again and continue
OL,7,Fmy work without being under the shadow
OL,8,Fof threats of violence," Qayyum said in
OL,9,Fa statement, read at Huntingdon
OL,10,FMagistrates' Court.
